msgid "LCD Shield"
msgstr "LCD Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/lcd-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The LCD Shield is a 1.8 inch 128x160 SPI TFT for showing live frames or "
"debugging information directly from the OpenMV Cam. Ideal for field robotics"
" and stand-alone deployments."
msgstr ""
"El LCD Shield es una pantalla TFT SPI de 1,8 pulgadas y 128x160 para mostrar"
" fotogramas en directo o información de depuración directamente desde la "
"OpenMV Cam. Ideal para robótica de campo e implementaciones autónomas."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/lcd-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `LCD Shield product page "
"<https://openmv.io/products/lcd-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Para consultar la hoja de datos completa, fotos e información de compra, "
"visite la `página del producto LCD Shield <https://openmv.io/products/lcd-"
"shield>`_."

